## Method and Counters

Read every raw and candidate task in three contiguous groups: 1062-1076,
1077-1091, and 1092-1105. Independently checked requests, restrictions, contexts,
numbers, formulas, ordering, nesting, and absence of added explanatory material.
A read-only JSON comparison supplemented that semantic review; it did not invoke
the text-contract validator or any finalizer.

