## Disposition

No findings require revision within this bounded static-text review. Existing
source risks at 1084 and 1087 are preserved, not repaired or certified as
mathematically complete; 1090 preserves its established logical/printed identity
split. The faulty proof in 1080 remains task material, not an endorsed proof.
The verdict concerns fidelity to the supplied raw JSON, not renewed validation of
the scanned textbook.

Only `review.md` and `review.json` in this review directory were written. No
source, candidate, receipt, other worker artifact, code, dependency, Git state,
database, app, agent, chat, or publication state was changed. The review stops
here; no figure/render/full-modern/key/choice approval or finalization follows.
